2. ✅ Zero `categoryPath` references in product discovery code
3. ✅ Search supports catalogue-based filtering
4. ✅ Navigation renders from `catalogue-index.json` (no live fetches)
5. ✅ TypeScript coverage at 100% for all discovery paths
6. ✅ All 6 scope contracts pass DoD verification
7. ✅ No visual or functional regressions in product discovery

